{"title":"Toronto Professionals & Investors Mixer: AI, Capital & Cash Flow","startsAt":"2026-10-22T18:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-22T20:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Phenom Society hosts curated Toronto gatherings where business owners, operators, investors, and professionals exchange practical ideas and build valuable relationships.\n\n**Not a pitch night.** Not a guru seminar. Not a room full of people handing out business cards and hoping something happens.\n\n**The goal is simple:** bring useful people together around business, investing, financing, private markets, AI, and building in this economy.\n\nIf you’re growing a business, managing clients, looking at investment opportunities, trying to understand where AI fits into your work, or just want to meet serious people in Toronto, come through.\nWe’ll keep it casual, but intentional.\n\n**Expect:**\n\\- business owners\\, professionals\\, and investors\n\\- conversations around capital\\, AI\\, sales\\, financing\\, and investing\n\\- real networking without the weird pressure\n\\- people who are actually building\\, investing\\, or actively looking for better rooms\n\n**This is a good fit if you are:**\n\\- a business owner or founder\n\\- a professional interested in investing\\, business\\, or private markets\n\\- an investor or private\\-market curious professional\n\\- in sales\\, finance\\, real estate\\, lending\\, or professional services\n\\- building with AI or trying to understand how it applies to your work\n\\- looking to meet serious people in Toronto without the usual networking\\-event nonsense\n\n**This is probably not for you** **if** you’re looking for a get-rich-quick pitch, a crypto hype room, or a room where everyone is trying to sell each other immediately.\n\nThis event is for education, networking, and general discussion only.\nNothing shared should be taken as investment, legal, tax, or financial advice.\n\n**What happens:**\n6:30 PM — Arrival + casual networking\n7:00 PM — Short welcome / room framing\n7:10 PM — Open networking + real conversations\n8:30 PM — Wrap\n\n**Space is limited to 20 people** so the room stays small enough for real conversations.\n\n**RSVP** if you want to meet sharper people in Toronto building around business, capital, AI, and wealth.","venue":{"name":"Toronto","address":"Toronto, ON, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.649296,"lng":-79.37774,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Phenom Society | Business, Investing & Wealth Network","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/8/7/7/highres_536286263.jpeg"}